         gave constant +11.3 mm pos error; moving to -0.1838 doubled it to ~22.6 mm
         (wrong direction); -0.1612 is the corrected value. -->
    <origin xyz="0 -0.1612 0" rpy="1.5708 0 0" />
    <parent link="link_6" />
